.venv/

# The approved mhd finalization plan, kept in the checkout on purpose and
# deliberately untracked: it is the recovery copy a long session rereads, and
# `HANDOFF.md` points at it. A working plan is not a published document —
# the durable, committed record of the same decisions is `HANDOFF.md` §5, and
# a user-facing summary would belong in `CHANGELOG.md`. Never `git add` this.
/MHD-FINALIZATION-PLAN.md
